      "id": "claim_17a8480c15bd43ddaa39a79f060c6163",
      "statement": "check_commit is the single implementation of the ten check items shared by the CLI (pre-commit hook and CI) and the registry's index build: it checks repository structure, then each skill, then skill pairs, and history items only when a base commit is given.",
