      "id": "claim_fe10c591ada840ad82f7ed3742335970",
      "statement": "Item 1 requires the .harness-catalog marker to parse as TOML with the supported layout and the presence of skills/, a CI workflow (.github/workflows/ or .gitlab-ci.yml), .pre-commit-config.yaml and README.md; item 2 requires skills/ to contain only directories (plus .gitkeep) each holding SKILL.md.",
